      "note": "\\(I = \\lim \\frac{{2n - 3}}{{2{n^2} + 3n + 1}}\\)\\( = \\lim \\frac{{{n^2}\\left( {\\frac{2}{n} - \\frac{3}{{{n^2}}}} \\right)}}{{{n^2}\\left( {2 + \\frac{3}{n} + \\frac{1}{{{n^2}}}} \\right)}}\\)\\( = \\lim \\frac{{\\frac{2}{n} - \\frac{3}{{{n^2}}}}}{{2 + \\frac{3}{n} + \\frac{1}{{{n^2}}}}}\\)\\( = 0\\)."
